        dct:description "Vendors `datasets/epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus/` with 4 primary DOIs in `paper_citations.bib` (`10.1126/science.1238842`, `10.1103/PhysRevLett.107.078104`, `10.1103/PhysRevLett.110.024302`, `10.1073/pnas.1205669109`), `scout_manifest.json`, and `epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus_reference.json`, but lacks runtime SHA-256 verification in `2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py`." ;
